    "and that $\\mu$ is absolutely continuos w.r.t. $\\nu$: then there exists a non-negative, measurable function $\\rho$ on X.  \n",
    "Monotone class $\\longrightarrow$ Suppose $\\mathscr M$ is a monotone class of subsets of a set X, and suppose $\\mathscr M$ contains an\n",
