    "$\\bullet$ $\\psi$(0) = 0 $\\implies$ $\\mathbf {B}$ = 0  \n",
    "$\\bullet$ $\\psi ( \\mathbf {L}$) = 0 $\\sin ({k}{\\mathbf L})$ = 0  \n",
    "So:\n",
    "    k = $\\frac{{n} \\pi}{L}$  \n",
    "Final wavefunction:  \n",
    "    $\\psi_n$(x) = $\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{L}}$ $\\sin$ $\\left( \\frac{{n} \\pi {x}}{L} \\right)$  \n",
