    "$\\mathbf {P}$ = $\\int_0^{ \\frac{L}{2}}|\\psi_1|^2$ dx  \n",
    "              = $\\frac{2}{L}$ $\\int_0^{\\frac{L}{2}}$ $\\sin^2$ $\\left( \\frac{\\pi {x}}{L} \\right)$ dx  \n",
    "Result:  \n",
