    "Q8. Commutator & Uncertainty\n",
    "(a) Show:  \n",
    "    [$\\hat {x}, \\hat {p}]$ = i$\\hbar$  \n",
    "    Apply to function f(x):  \n",
    "        $\\hat {x} \\hat {p}$f = x(-i$\\hbar$f')  \n",
    "                                 $\\hat {p} \\hat {x}$f = -i$\\hbar$ $\\frac{d}{d{x}}$(xf) = -i$\\hbar$(f + xf')  \n",
    "   Subtract:  \n",
    "        [$\\hat x, \\hat p]$f = i$\\hbar$f  \n",
    "   Thus:  \n",
    "        [$\\hat x, \\hat p]$ = i$\\hbar$  \n",
    "(b) Uncertainty Principle  \n",
    "    General relation:  \n",
