    "                                                                                          \n",
    "Perturbed System $\\rightarrow$ $\\hat H$ = $\\frac{\\hat p^2}{2m}$ + $\\frac{1}{2} m^2 \\omega^2 x^2$ - $\\frac{\\lambda}{2} x^2$,  \n",
